{
  "scene": {
    "id": 0,
    "language": "[0]Okay, so, uh, when you're moving here, uh, there is no need to consider like, moving above the teammate, uh, uh, or six meter from the opponent and so on. Just- all you need to do- like, all you need to consider is, you just wanna move to the side of the field, either to the left or to the right from where you started, by about like two to four meters. Um, that's it. That's all you gotta do. No need to consider other conditions. [1]And you can also, um, receive the ball on th- you don't have to stop and receive the ball. You can actually receive the ball as you are moving towards, uh, your destination. [2]Here, um, you don't have to wait until the defender pressures you. You can just wait th- I mean, the moment defender s- starts moving towards you, you can just uh, um, start um, uh, you can just, uh... That's, th- that's the only condition you should check. Defender moving towards you. You don't have to check the other conditions.",
